'''M. Bison''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 575
|rarity = UR
|name1 = M. Bison
|name2 = M. Bison CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''M. Bison CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Against [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies, M. Bison acts as a decent attacker, providing fine damage at a moderate range, all with guaranteed [[Barrier Breaker]]. He should be used alongside meatshields and supporters, not differently than the likes of [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], but with the extra safety provided by his health.

Against [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], M. Bison is a solid all-rounder who can hold the frontline and take on unburrowing Zombies with ease, not too differently than [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Thermae D-Lux]], but without the [[Freeze]] and with a much worse multi-hit.

In general, his DPS is low for his range and is even worse in practice due to the horrible timing of his multi-hit, meaning that M. Bison should not be used in stages where he cannot make use of his abilities.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner & Breaker}}

